Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:13.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the CES stage, Roland. Have fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.68,0:00:19.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want you to think back to the time before electricity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.60,0:00:29.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,The world moved at the pace of people, but horses stretched our distances.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.20,0:00:41.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Steam powered our machines and ideas moved only as fast as a letter or a human voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.52,0:00:45.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then electricity arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.68,0:00:50.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,This general purpose technology became the foundation of modern life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.44,0:00:56.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,It turned night into day, amplified human capabilities,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.93,0:01:03.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,boosted productivity and powered progress that once felt out of reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.92,0:01:08.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,At Siemens, we brought this world to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.96,0:01:14.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Pioneering telecommunications and electric grids.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.80,0:01:23.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Developing the machines that accelerated mass production, moving people and goods via electric trains.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.28,0:01:29.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Scaling the benefits of electricity all around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.76,0:01:33.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fast forward one and a half centuries later,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.58,0:01:40.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,another general purpose technology has arrived, and this time it's not about energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.88,0:01:44.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's about intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.00,0:01:52.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Artificial Intelligence will be as transformative for this century as electricity was for the last.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.96,0:01:56.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's redefining how we design and manufacture products.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.48,0:02:00.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,From the phones in your hands to the cars you drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.04,0:02:08.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's revolutionizing how we build and operate infrastructure including buildings just like this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.24,0:02:19.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it's allowing us to make entire systems, grids, cities, economies more adaptive and more efficient.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.36,0:02:25.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,A century ago, Siemens helped build the world in the light of electricity.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.84,0:02:32.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now we get to do it again in the age of intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.08,0:02:37.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are powering the industrial AI revolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.12,0:02:42.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,It has already begun, and it's picking up steam faster than steam ever did.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.88,0:02:47.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,In fact, steam took 60 years to transform society.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.92,0:02:48.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Electricity.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.88,0:02:52.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,30 computers, 15 for AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.16,0:03:03.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're looking at seven years or less before intelligence is embedded in the system we rely on every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.04,0:03:07.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that changes something fundamentally,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.50,0:03:15.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,because when an AI enters a physical system, it stops being a feature.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.12,0:03:16.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,It becomes a force.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.72,0:03:20.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,A force with direct real world impact.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.24,0:03:26.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,A force that transforms how we design and build, how factories produce,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.50,0:03:31.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,how infrastructure operates, how the world powers itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.52,0:03:35.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, how do we do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.12,0:03:37.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,How can we make this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.44,0:03:47.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,How can we do all of this at speed and scale and at the same time, in a way that it's reliable and safe and
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.64,0:03:54.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,hallucination is not acceptable when AI is deployed in the industrial world?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.88,0:04:01.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today we are making it easy for you to scale industrial AI in the real world
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.01,0:04:03.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,systems to create real world impact.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.92,0:04:14.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are bringing together AI powered technologies, industrial domain know how and the right partners.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.16,0:04:22.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the whole thing is connected by data, valuable industrial data and all in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.32,0:04:26.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,In our Siemens Xcelerator marketplace.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.24,0:04:29.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,So let's have a look at these elements one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.68,0:04:32.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,And let's start first with the right technologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.88,0:04:41.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is about software hardware compute highly performant compute with GPUs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.92,0:04:46.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,And of course it is about data.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.32,0:04:48.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here comes the good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.00,0:04:57.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Many companies have already some important elements in place, but this does not make them AI ready yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.12,0:05:02.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Digital twins can simulate and software can solve problems,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.08,0:05:07.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,but they do not recommend what to do next in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.12,0:05:16.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,Compute is CPU based with AI needs GPUs to deploy its full power and speed,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.01,0:05:23.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,and too often data is fragmented, trapped in silos and unused.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.36,0:05:33.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's why it is so important to have an end to end AI industrial stack to make impact in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.52,0:05:39.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,And at Siemens, we are able to build this because we have been working with AI
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.98,0:05:42.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,for industry for more than 50 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.96,0:05:46.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, Siemens has more than 1,500 AI experts,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.46,0:05:52.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,and all our engineers live in both worlds in the digital and in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.20,0:06:04.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,And all our colleagues, over 250,000 of them, bring deep domain knowhow in our 30 industrial verticals.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.32,0:06:11.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that's because for decades, Siemens has been helping customers in the United States and all over
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.52,0:06:15.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,the world to automate manufacturing, to run railway networks,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.92,0:06:20.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,to design and operate grids, or to operate buildings more efficiently.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.96,0:06:31.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,In fact, today, in one out of three manufacturing machines worldwide runs a Siemens controller.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.36,0:06:37.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,With our software, you can build the most comprehensive digital twin of products and
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.21,0:06:39.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,the cost of a whole manufacturing site.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.92,0:06:51.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,And now we are adding AI Decades of experience in software, hardware and AI And this experience means we have the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.91,0:06:59.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,domain know how to identify which data matter and how to cluster it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.12,0:07:06.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Which AI applications make sense and which decisions should be left to humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.24,0:07:08.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,And finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.96,0:07:16.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our partners for industrial AI to make use of all of this industrial design, manufacturing and operating data.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.72,0:07:19.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,You need a huge amount of compute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.96,0:07:28.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Gigantic centralized AI factories that are run by our partners like AWS or Microsoft,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.32,0:07:35.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,but also at the edge, very close to your machines, to your infrastructure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.28,0:07:45.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,With this massive GPU process powered compute digital twins no longer explore just thousands
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.65,0:07:49.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,of options, but hundreds of thousands of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.84,0:07:58.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Complex industrial foundation models can get trained on unprecedented amounts of industrial data.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.00,0:08:03.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,And a digital twin can control a whole plant in real time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.92,0:08:11.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,When these things come together, the right technologies, industry domain knowhow, and the right partners.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.20,0:08:16.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's when we stop just reporting issues and start anticipating them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.96,0:08:24.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's when humans stop reacting to errors because machines have started to act and adjust autonomously.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.24,0:08:32.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's when companies can turn ideas into real world impact with speed, quality and efficiency.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.92,0:08:40.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's the industrial AI revolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.88,0:08:45.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, I mentioned partners, the right partners, the best partners.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.92,0:08:50.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,And including a very special friend of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.64,0:08:53.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we hit it off immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.28,0:08:56.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,He has a visionary engineering mindset.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.72,0:09:01.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,He thinks through problems from first principles.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.12,0:09:06.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,He anticipates the next development step of AI technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.40,0:09:14.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,And he has both bold vision and the ability to make things happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.00,0:09:17.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please welcome Jensen Huang.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.38,0:09:31.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Roland! Happy new year!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.39,0:09:44.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,Happy new year! Happy new year! Please 200 years old. You've seen a few of these Industrial revolutions.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.28,0:09:48.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are not quite 200 years, but we are heading for 175.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.64,0:09:50.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Exactly, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.24,0:09:53.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we came a long way with our partnership too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.20,0:09:56.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,I mean, we kicked it off a couple of years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.24,0:09:57.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,I remember that very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.92,0:10:02.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,Have the same vision, industrial AI operating system that we want to build,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.21,0:10:04.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,huge opportunities for our customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.32,0:10:06.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,So what's with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.24,0:10:07.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Where are we on this journey?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.36,0:10:09.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know? Yeah, it's it's an incredible thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.36,0:10:15.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,So we, we did a press conference at Siemens headquarters in Munich.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.28,0:10:17.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,How many? Yeah. How many years ago was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.44,0:10:19.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,2022. It was only 2022. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.76,0:10:21.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it was three years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.44,0:10:24.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we spoke about this moment in fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.48,0:10:30.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,And Siemens is is unquestionably at the foundation of every industry that we
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.77,0:10:34.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,participate in, that the world builds on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.16,0:10:42.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,And, we had a vision that that, Siemens and this was your vision to turn Siemens into a software defined company in a
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.22,0:10:47.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,lot of ways, described it in a way very similar to a computer company.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.04,0:10:52.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it would it would, of course, have the underlying infrastructure of computing,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.25,0:10:56.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,but mostly on top, your infrastructure software, artificial intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.88,0:11:03.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it's going to revolutionize the way things are designed, simulated, planned and operated.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.68,0:11:05.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that was the vision you described.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.68,0:11:07.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we spoke about three years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.92,0:11:08.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,And here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.88,0:11:11.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, here we are at the beginning of that journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.68,0:11:14.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,And, all the pieces are now finally coming together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.40,0:11:15.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,It seems to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.44,0:11:17.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,And talking about what you achieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.20,0:11:22.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,I brought an example, you know, that HD Hyundai. I mean, they built ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.48,0:11:26.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,huge ships, and and shipyards, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.08,0:11:28.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,And they use our technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.16,0:11:28.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.48,0:11:29.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're sitting on Nvidia.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.60,0:11:31.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a digital twin of an entire ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.76,0:11:35.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every nut and bolt is in there is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.28,0:11:39.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,I mean, this is the full CAD of the ship visiting the pavilion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.36,0:11:41.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Precise digital twin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.60,0:11:44.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,And, and you see also the the the people working on the ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.96,0:11:45.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,You simulate everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.84,0:11:48.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,By the way, these ships are they look alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.40,0:11:52.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,So the body is the same, but each of them is individual.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.00,0:11:56.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,So you really have to be very, very clear how you design that you optimize in the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.69,0:11:59.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,digital world and then you build it, for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.36,0:12:01.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that's where our whole stack comes together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.68,0:12:03.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Complimentary technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.36,0:12:07.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,And for the photorealistic, representation we use Omniverse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.72,0:12:10.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this was really quite a perfect. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.08,0:12:17.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is quite a perfect example of the type of work that we do together in this realization of this digital
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.26,0:12:21.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,twin idea that you would design, every aspect of engineering.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.36,0:12:30.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's not just the not just the CAD, but the computing, the electronics, all of it would be integrated and then and built into a
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.34,0:12:35.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,digital twin, it would, of course, run all of the software in the digital twin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.92,0:12:39.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,And in the future, I hope that's the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.28,0:12:43.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,The digital twin of a ship will actually put it in the ocean,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.38,0:12:47.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,a virtual simulation of the ocean and see it completely operate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.68,0:12:48.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Exactly. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.56,0:12:51.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,And you have only one option to get it onto water.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.36,0:12:54.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,If then you have a problem, by the way. So.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.24,0:12:59.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, we talked about bringing our partners up to the next level.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.28,0:13:04.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,And, the whole idea is obviously to take these examples and scale them even faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.40,0:13:11.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,And of course, to make it AI enabled, I'm talking about industrially, I would really it's the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.84,0:13:15.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we picked five areas of collaboration where we want to intensify.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.60,0:13:18.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,And, and that's, good news for our customers too, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.96,0:13:20.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let me start with the first one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.08,0:13:21.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Take them off one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.60,0:13:25.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,The first one is AI native chip design.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.44,0:13:28.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, if it comes to chip design, I don't need to tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.56,0:13:31.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Obviously, you're with each next generation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.12,0:13:33.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're getting closer to the physical limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.92,0:13:36.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,So tell me what what the challenges are and what can we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.72,0:13:42.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, let's use let's use, our latest generation that we just announced yesterday as an example,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.57,0:13:48.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera Rubin, Vera Rubin, in order to build the latest generation GPU, people think that our GPU is a chip.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.96,0:13:49.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is a chip.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.92,0:13:57.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,It consists of a chip, but ultimately, in order for these GPUs to scale up to process the level of AI
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.31,0:14:02.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,that's necessary at the frontier, these GPUs are essentially one giant rack,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.88,0:14:07.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,and this entire rack is, in the case of Vera Rubin, 240kW.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.64,0:14:13.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,It consists of altogether 220 trillion transistors.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.04,0:14:20.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,We had to design six different unique chips CPU, GPU, networking, multiple types of networking switches.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.88,0:14:23.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,One is for scale up, one is for scale out,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.99,0:14:29.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,and a smart net and a data processor for storage all for AI memory basically.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.68,0:14:34.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,All of this stuff came together is 220 trillion transistors,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.62,0:14:43.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,is two tons and 150,000 engineering years came together to build this one system that we announced yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.60,0:14:50.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,And in order to do this perfectly at a rhythm that our company runs at the level of chip design,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.77,0:14:56.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,system design, system integration, thermals, electricals, all of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.00,0:15:04.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,In a lot of ways, our GPUs, it's a little bit like that HD Hyundai ship and, and what we are hoping for and the reason why we're
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.50,0:15:11.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,partnering so closely together is so that we could build that Vera Rubin in the future as a digital twin,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.48,0:15:17.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,the entire system as a digital twin, not just the chips, but the systems, the chips,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.06,0:15:24.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,everything together, cooling thermals and run the thermal simulation directly through it as it is a digital twin.
