Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.92,0:27:10.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it starts, for example, with the plan in Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.80,0:27:12.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,I was talking about it's talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.32,0:27:17.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,We talk about EDA software simulation and bringing that to the next level to speed
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.34,0:27:19.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,up our, each other's development.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.36,0:27:20.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.24,0:27:24.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're going to we're going to work together to accelerate all of your EDA software,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.80,0:27:30.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,which we can then use to design our chips faster so that we could accelerate your EDA software faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.40,0:27:36.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're going to we're going to we're going to use we're going to accelerate all of your Simcenter software
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.99,0:27:41.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,so that we could use it to design and simulate our our AI factories faster,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.70,0:27:45.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,so that we could create AIs that makes AI, makes simcenter faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.84,0:27:51.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,And and if you look at this and we're going to we're going to, we're going to use,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.47,0:27:58.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,Siemens so that we could automate our factories to build, even more amazing supercomputers so that we could
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.82,0:28:02.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,create AIs to make your AI factories even more productive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.80,0:28:09.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Doesn't that sound like the perfect partnership of two companies coming together?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.20,0:28:21.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah. And that's why that's why whenever Roland reaches out and he needs a bug fix, I fix it right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.28,0:28:26.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because I fix his bug, which directly comes back to my company, my engineers go faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.24,0:28:28.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I tell you this works both ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.56,0:28:32.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,So that’s, You have a call. So Jensen.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.64,0:28:35.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much for the partnership. Thank you, The best is ahead of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.40,0:28:44.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a, we are at the beginning of a new industrial revolution and and what what perfect company for all of that capability
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.32,0:28:49.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,to come together than the company at the center of every industrial revolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.28,0:28:52.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so it's a great privilege to partner with Siemens.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.32,0:28:59.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it's incredible to be friends with you and and to see your, your vision of Siemens come together and,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.91,0:29:06.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,for our journey of, you know, reinventing industry, to, achieve this milestone is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.64,0:29:07.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,So thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.36,0:29:18.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Siemens and Nvidia operating the industrial production system Well. When I last spoke at CES,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.45,0:29:32.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I shared a vision of the industrial metaverse, a vision for a virtual world that helps us make the real world better.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.40,0:29:36.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, we are making this vision a reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.32,0:29:42.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are excited to launch our Digital Twin Composer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.24,0:29:49.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,With a Digital Twin Composer, you can create a virtual 3D model of any product, any plant,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.64,0:29:56.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,any process, bring it to life in a photorealistic scene that you built and in real time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.88,0:30:06.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Digital Twin Composer is so powerful because you can connect the digital twin to the real world and to real time data,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.97,0:30:14.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,from engineering data to weather data, even time series data coming from your machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.16,0:30:20.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,And when something worked well or something went wrong, you can go back in time and you find out why.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.40,0:30:25.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Or you can jump to the future to simulate the scenario before you build it in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.96,0:30:32.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,And if you want to unlock the full benefits of the Digital Twin Composer,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.88,0:30:38.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,you connect it to our operations software and our hardware stack.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.16,0:30:44.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,That when you can make real world changes from the virtual environment, optimize machine speed,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.80,0:30:51.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,temperature, pressure, or any parameter that determines the quality in the yield of your plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.16,0:30:57.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is how we combine the real and the digital worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.28,0:31:08.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,This Digital Twin Composer will be available on our Siemens Xcelerator marketplace in just a few moments.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.16,0:31:14.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,PepsiCo PepsiCo is among the first companies to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.64,0:31:24.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this brings me to our next guest who is leading the way when it comes to the digitalization of PepsiCo,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.12,0:31:31.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,making the company smarter, more efficient, more sustainable with industrial AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.20,0:31:39.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please welcome Athina Kanioura.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.76,0:31:49.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a great year.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.12,0:31:50.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your year, great year!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.80,0:31:53.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is, it is. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.60,0:31:58.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,So tell us about the challenge PepsiCo's is navigating through.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.96,0:32:04.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,And these challenges are very much alike to both the whole food and beverage industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.28,0:32:06.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.16,0:32:11.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,And as Roland said I'm very privileged to be on stage with Roland and, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.26,0:32:15.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,PepsiCo has been pioneering some of these innovation with you and Nvidia.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.92,0:32:22.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,So but from farm to shelf, PepsiCo, has been operating in a very extraordinary and very complex
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.10,0:32:25.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,environment because we have operations everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.36,0:32:27.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,We serve billions of consumers.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.60,0:32:29.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have billions of touch points per day.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.84,0:32:35.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,So consumers expect the products to be everywhere every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.68,0:32:37.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,In real time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.04,0:32:40.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we want to be able to fulfill the supply.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.16,0:32:45.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,So imagine a world where you have demand spikes, where you have unusual events.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.68,0:32:51.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,When you have tornadoes, you have to be able to fulfill this demand in a very digital way,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.52,0:32:54.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,where the physical footprint cannot be a showstopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.96,0:32:59.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right. So a ton of a supply chain and delivering.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.92,0:33:03.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look at your existing warehouses.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.20,0:33:08.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah. So I mean, many of you know, especially the ones that come from the manufacturing world,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.92,0:33:14.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,we have great warehouses that are fully modernized, but we also have warehouses that are very old.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.88,0:33:19.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,So in this specific case, this warehouse is half a century old.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.52,0:33:24.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that means in the current state, it really cannot serve and deliver the demand.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.48,0:33:28.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,That might change depending on the events.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.08,0:33:29.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,So what is the answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.36,0:33:30.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the answer cannot.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.48,0:33:33.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,These cannot be I will just build more capacity.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.84,0:33:39.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,The answer must be I need to find a way to maximize the capacity that I have to drive more
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.56,0:33:43.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,operational efficiency and therefore increase the throughput.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.44,0:33:52.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,So what we wanted to do is adopt a digital first design approach, and that means to leverage the digital twins and
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.16,0:33:59.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,adopting AI at scale in all the parts of the operations where we were able to co-design and
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.12,0:34:04.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,simulate and optimize the layout before any physical building begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.40,0:34:08.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,So and to do that, you decided to use our Digital Twin Composer.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.84,0:34:11.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Share your experience. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.52,0:34:13.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,First of all, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.16,0:34:15.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the partnership.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.44,0:34:16.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the investment.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.64,0:34:20.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you for taking our feedback into product innovation.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.00,0:34:22.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,And today we just had a press release. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.80,0:34:27.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are very excited to help save this technology in partnership with Nvidia.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.60,0:34:31.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,And of course, Siemens this is the first of its kind for the industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.84,0:34:38.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is how we build AI and digital twins into our operations across the board globally.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.32,0:34:42.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,When we say operations, that is manufacturing, warehousing,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.54,0:34:47.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,distribution centers, mixing centers and every part of logistics.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.20,0:34:52.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,So the Digital Twin Composer allows us to do everything in the virtual world,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.30,0:34:58.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,being able to simulate everything in a way where we don't have to spend a single dollar on the
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.53,0:35:02.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,physical plant before we know that design is the final design.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.64,0:35:08.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,So therefore we are able to pull now massive amounts of data that we are able to
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.27,0:35:11.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,simulate in a unified, immersive environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.44,0:35:17.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,That means we can create a beautiful, photorealistic way, which you saw before in the discussion.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.76,0:35:19.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,And with the AI powered simulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.92,0:35:27.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now we can explore hundreds or thousands of potential layouts to find the most efficient options.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.04,0:35:34.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Therefore, with a digital twin, this type of task that would have normally taken months now takes days.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.32,0:35:41.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, and the question would be then what does that do to your customers?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.20,0:35:48.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Well obviously for us, making sure we serve our customers in the most efficient way where we provide the inventory
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.22,0:35:51.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,and we have the intelligent network where both the plants,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.61,0:35:58.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,the warehouses and the network is able to anticipate the demand and fine tune operations in real time is a must.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.16,0:36:02.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,So therefore, we have had significant impact even in the first three months.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.72,0:36:08.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,So one good example is in the Gatorade plant in the US we use the Digital Twin Composer.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.24,0:36:11.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,We were able to drive two very meaningful results.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.52,0:36:16.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,One is to increase efficiency 20% just in three months.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.08,0:36:21.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,And obviously if we were to look at we have estimated how this capabilities will benefit the company.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.28,0:36:26.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,We estimate the CapEx reduction of 10 to 15% across all the operations.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.48,0:36:28.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,So for us, this is just the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.72,0:36:33.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are very hopeful about what this technology can do when it comes to serving our
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.11,0:36:34.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,customers, serving our consumers.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.88,0:36:37.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I would really to thank you for the great partnership.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.36,0:36:38.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the partnership.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.72,0:36:40.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,And, this is just the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.64,0:36:52.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,We want to see more and we will see more. Athina, Thank you very much. Thank you so much. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.96,0:36:59.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,You have seen the great impacts that the Digital Twin Composer is having on PepsiCo facilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.12,0:37:03.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Using this technology, even in the design phase of new plants matters,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.63,0:37:10.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,especially in the United States, because it accelerates the ramp up of new manufacturing sites and allows our
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.65,0:37:14.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,customers to make them more productive and energy efficient.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.52,0:37:18.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,KION uses our technology to transform warehouses entire supply chains too.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.80,0:37:20.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.24,0:37:29.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,KION the supply chain solutions company is scaling up physical AI and automation solutions to orchestrate customer supply
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.06,0:37:35.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,chains inside the four walls and up and down the supply chain with AI, digital twins,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.26,0:37:42.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,a new supply chain solution begins as a digital twin compressing solutioning from years to months.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.12,0:37:48.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can learn more about the Digital Composer at our booth.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.00,0:37:57.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Also on this CES show floor when you will meet the team from PAVE 360.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.52,0:38:04.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,PAVE 360 automotive is our digital twin for autonomous driving system,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.92,0:38:09.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,and it's ready to use right off the shelf.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.36,0:38:13.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,It replicates real vehicle hardware in the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.92,0:38:18.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Developers can simulate real world driving conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.32,0:38:25.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,They can test the autonomous system before a car even exists, and this accelerates the development.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.36,0:38:31.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,PAVE 360 automotive also replicates how the software in the car behaves,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.81,0:38:41.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,and better yet, it integrates the latest automotive IP from our partner ARM for advanced driver assistance
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.30,0:38:46.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,systems, infotainment and the AI driven cockpit features.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.40,0:38:54.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a solution that will scale autonomous driving faster with the power of industrial AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.88,0:39:05.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now imagine what happens when we apply industrial AI to something more personal, even more complex.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.28,0:39:09.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your body, your health.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.44,0:39:12.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Life sciences.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.08,0:39:17.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Bringing new medicines to the market costs a lot of time and money.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.12,0:39:21.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Over the last 50 years, these costs have risen dramatically.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.84,0:39:29.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,It often takes more than ten years and costs are up to $2 billion.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.60,0:39:34.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Patients and pharmaceutical companies obviously want to have faster innovations.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.56,0:39:42.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,That means tackling every step in the chain from early research to manufacturing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.00,0:39:46.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we bring AI to all these steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.48,0:39:49.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's take the example of a new cancer drug.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.92,0:39:53.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,In research lab scientists create billions of data points.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.36,0:40:00.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, this data is scattered across industries and instruments and files and around the world
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.65,0:40:06.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,through our platform, Luma scientists use AI to bring this data together and
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.54,0:40:11.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,structure it so you can ask questions in natural language.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.04,0:40:19.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,Next step, scientists identify the most promising molecular structure of the cancer drug with AI powered
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.82,0:40:24.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,simulations that can simulate the behavior of the molecule.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.80,0:40:31.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,2.5 million times more efficiently than ever before.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.36,0:40:39.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this includes how molecules move and flex, how they interact with each other, or how stable they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.20,0:40:40.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Over time.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.08,0:40:50.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,But then, when you need to go from making a small batch in the lab to producing at scale without the
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.05,0:40:55.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,slightest deviation in the recipe, and with exactly the same result,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.46,0:41:01.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,even for world class production experts, this means a lot of trial and error.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.60,0:41:07.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,A lot of experiments in a bioreactor, and our digital twin of a bioreactor.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.44,0:41:11.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can run these experiments in the digital world, first.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.20,0:41:14.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,You simulate until you have the highest quality and the highest output.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.88,0:41:20.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,And only then and only then you start the production.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.56,0:41:27.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Siemens technology accelerates all steps from discovery to manufacturing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.12,0:41:34.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,Life saving therapies can make it to the market as much as 50% faster,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.70,0:41:39.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,and at every stage, AI speeds things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.04,0:41:45.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,This requires powerful AI infrastructure too.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.04,0:41:50.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,The GPUs used in the AI factories I talked about with Jensen,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.38,0:41:57.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,but also the cloud infrastructure we get from partners like Microsoft on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.20,0:42:01.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's hear from my friend Satya Nadella.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.16,0:42:03.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thanks so much, Roland.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.52,0:42:06.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's fantastic to join all of you at CES.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.96,0:42:14.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the industrial sector we have an incredible opportunity to bring together digital intelligence with physical
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.32,0:42:19.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,operations, to reinvent things that are designed, built and run in this era of AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.76,0:42:25.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we're already seeing the industrial AI drive better outcomes in both productivity as well as in safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.92,0:42:30.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's why our partnership with Siemens is so important to us at Microsoft.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.40,0:42:35.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,By combining your deep domain expertise with our trusted cloud and AI capabilities,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.70,0:42:40.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,we are helping our customers tackle some of today's most pressing challenges,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.61,0:42:45.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,from sustainable energy and transportation to smart cities and precision medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.84,0:42:51.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm especially excited about the core engineering work our teams are driving to build custom models and
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.90,0:42:55.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,agents that get trained with real world industrial data.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.20,0:42:57.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,And of course, we're just getting started.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.52,0:43:01.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,I could not be more optimistic about what we do together and achieve together.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.68,0:43:03.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you all so very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.76,0:43:07.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you Satya.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.92,0:43:13.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, custom models, agents and of course Copilots.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.68,0:43:21.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's talk more about it with Jay Parikh.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.24,0:43:35.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hi Nice seeing you So Jay, you are leading Microsoft's core AI team.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.68,0:43:41.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,You put all AI experts together which tells me again this is a foundational technology
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.11,0:43:43.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,with skills across the whole company.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.44,0:43:50.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, where are you in the step of really making this AI, journey creating impact for your customers?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.88,0:43:53.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Well, first of all, thank you for the partnership.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.36,0:43:57.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Excited about what we're working on today and also going forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.44,0:44:03.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,So as what we're seeing today is really three waves with more waves coming in terms of AI,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.60,0:44:07.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,the first wave was really folks using AI as a chat bot, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.84,0:44:11.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ask it simple questions, maybe do code completions.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.04,0:44:16.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,The second wave is much more focused on delegating a specific task to AI,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.01,0:44:21.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,may be giving it a task to do and come up with a market strategy, document,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.11,0:44:26.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,or proposal to do these longer running, kind of more sophisticated tasks.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.08,0:44:34.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, what we're seeing emerging in this third wave is this set of agents working with and orchestrating a set of different
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.25,0:44:39.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,agents to be able to do asynchronous work, but much more complicated work, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.68,0:44:41.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Longer running tasks.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.36,0:44:47.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it is this third wave that we're focused on building because you need multiple models.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.84,0:44:49.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,You need to be able to train your own models, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.84,0:44:52.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,You need to be able to bring in your enterprise data.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.24,0:44:58.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,You need to be able to orchestrate these agents, but you also need to do it with security,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.80,0:45:05.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,with observability, with compliance with all of that scale, enterprise ready abstractions.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.36,0:45:11.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right. And it is this area in this third wave that I'm most excited for us to be working together,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.68,0:45:17.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,because this third wave is how we bring this technology to specific use cases and industries.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.68,0:45:24.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,But Roland, I'm really curious is like this third wave, how does this show up as you lead industrials with AI?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.48,0:45:28.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,How is this manifesting with your customers? And, I mean, there are many examples.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.96,0:45:32.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,I brought one, it's just a very exciting one.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.08,0:45:37.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,We talk about Rolls Royce they do turbines for airplanes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.44,0:45:42.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I mean, obviously you want to have these turbines to to work hundred percent reliable.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.56,0:45:45.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,And of course fuel efficient.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.04,0:45:49.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,And within these turbines they have alot of design parts coming,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.10,0:45:53.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,these are designed with Siemens software and technology from Microsoft.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.60,0:45:56.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,And there's a particular one which is a hydraulic pump.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.40,0:45:59.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that makes this machine turning.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.04,0:46:03.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,So this pump has now a digital twin of the pump itself,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.17,0:46:07.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,but it also is a digital twin of the machines machining it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.60,0:46:10.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we simulate the whole process.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.32,0:46:11.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,In programing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.44,0:46:17.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we use your technologies together with ours and simulated with amazing outcomes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.36,0:46:20.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,These pumps are much stiffer and lighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.64,0:46:24.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,But we use Microsoft as well here and AI technologies for.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.88,0:46:29.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah. And excited about the other things that we're working on with these joint AI copilots.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.60,0:46:34.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right. We're able to help reduce the programing time for can by 80%.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.80,0:46:38.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Drove drove up productivity in the factory by 30%.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.56,0:46:44.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then also excited to work with your team to bring the GitHub platform to all of the developers to
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.48,0:46:48.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,drive that innovation, that value for your customers faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.00,0:46:52.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Again, all built together on Microsoft's cloud and AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.00,0:46:54.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Exactly. And there are many more examples.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.64,0:46:55.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,The demand is huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.92,0:47:03.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the benefits of not only shortening the development time, but also the production time is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.12,0:47:06.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,We talked about technology, but you cannot stop there.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.96,0:47:10.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we know that you're very passionate about also the the other part,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.59,0:47:14.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,the cultural, the way how you transform the you have seen the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.16,0:47:14.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.64,0:47:15.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's it's hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.52,0:47:18.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I know that's the let's talk about it. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.40,0:47:24.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,So you know, I spent probably last year talking to about 2 or 300 customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.32,0:47:32.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it was fascinating because somewhere between probably 70 and 80% of my conversations with customers started or ended or was
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.60,0:47:38.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,dominated by this topic of change, about culture, about people, about organizations.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.08,0:47:40.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it was such an interesting set of conversations.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.88,0:47:45.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,And my kind of three current takeaways from those conversations were, one is like,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.61,0:47:51.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,we're all learning together, and we're sharing openly about what's happening in organizations,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.04,0:47:56.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,small startups to, you know, companies that are much, much, much bigger multinational.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.00,0:48:00.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,So this culture of change is something that we have to share openly and work together on.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.40,0:48:05.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,The second thing that I noticed and comes up in conversations is actually many of the employees.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.68,0:48:09.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Many of the workers are using this technology in their personal lives, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.52,0:48:10.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're using it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.48,0:48:16.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're actually really sophisticated with it for family, for personal growth, etc.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.32,0:48:22.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,but there are institutional headwinds to adopting it, using it inside the company, whether it be compliance,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.56,0:48:28.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,whether it be risk, whether it be security, whether it be finance, whether it be just misaligned incentives.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.80,0:48:34.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right. And then so it is our job to try to work and try to unlock and this value of
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.10,0:48:36.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,this creativity, this collaboration.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.40,0:48:42.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then third thing that I always encourage folks to do is really the potential intelligence of these models.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.88,0:48:48.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,The capabilities of the platforms that we're building here at Microsoft are so much
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.18,0:48:50.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,more capable than what we realized today.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.80,0:48:58.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,So my biggest encouragement to myself, to my teams, to our partners, is to really raise our level of ambition,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.35,0:49:03.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,of what we can do with AI to drive the world forward and to deliver more impact.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.84,0:49:06.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I tell you I can say it from my perspective.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.40,0:49:11.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,We see a lot of this changes also in working with you, working with our customers, but also with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.12,0:49:12.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,You come from a different environment,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.72,0:49:16.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,but we bring that together to our customers and they do appreciate it, I tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.16,0:49:18.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much for doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.00,0:49:20.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,And, this is just the start. Yes. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.64,0:49:27.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the partnership. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.60,0:49:33.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,So more powerful industrial copilots and now new Copilots.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.92,0:49:42.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today at CES, we are launching nine additional AI powered Siemens Industrial Copilots.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.32,0:49:50.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,They bring intelligence along the entire industrial value chain, transforming how we design,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.16,0:49:57.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,engineer and operate and well to help everyone access this kind of technology more easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.84,0:50:04.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are now putting it in the hands of our Shopfloor colleagues.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.56,0:50:11.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Or to be more precise, on their faces. Together with META.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.36,0:50:15.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are making Rayban META glasses for industrial AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.68,0:50:19.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,I actually we do not use the tinted ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.52,0:50:20.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,As you can imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.48,0:50:22.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Maybe if the sun is shining.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.32,0:50:25.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,But, there are also, natural ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.52,0:50:31.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,And, they tell our colleagues to get real time audio guidance through the glasses,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.14,0:50:34.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,which button to press, which parameters to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.56,0:50:41.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look at one of our factories, where these glasses will turn colleagues into connected
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.68,0:50:45.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,experts so they can have more impact in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.68,0:50:47.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Handsfree.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.44,0:50:52.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hi, I'm Sarah, I just started working at this factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.24,0:50:54.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Honestly, there's a ton to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.64,0:50:58.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's great having AI from Siemens to help me get familiar with everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.96,0:51:00.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Good morning Sarah.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.08,0:51:04.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's take a quick look at how the last shift went and what's coming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.56,0:51:10.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, you'll be operating the robotic assembly line.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.32,0:51:15.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've noticed an issue with some sensors at cell four that could lead to assembly faults later.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.76,0:51:19.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,A reset now can prevent that.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.28,0:51:21.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Should I guide you through the process?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.60,0:51:25.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,What I love about my AI is how easy it is to use.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.20,0:51:32.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,It brings together live machine data, knowledge from my colleagues and all of our standard operating
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.46,0:51:38.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,procedures, and explains everything in a way that makes sense to me at my pace,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.20,0:51:42.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,in my language, and now select restart with AI from Siemens.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.56,0:51:50.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can solve problems efficiently, quickly, confidently.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.88,0:51:57.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,The first test show that colleagues are more confident in their work, and they're also more productive.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.52,0:51:59.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's impact in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.68,0:52:03.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,By scaling industrial AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.44,0:52:15.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,But we're heading for another huge bottleneck power electric power AI factories and
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.51,0:52:20.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,data require gigawatts of electric power.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.48,0:52:31.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, what if what if you had an energy source that was clean, safe, affordable, and practically limitless?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.84,0:52:36.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's the promise of fusion power.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.08,0:52:39.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Which brings me to my next guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.28,0:52:47.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Commonwealth Fusion Systems is working on the world's first commercially viable machine to make fusion real.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.60,0:52:58.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please welcome Bob Mumgaard.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.24,0:53:05.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hello, Hi, Bob So, for the starters, what is fusion?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.28,0:53:06.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's a good question. So?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.72,0:53:08.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,So fusion is the power of the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.56,0:53:10.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's the power of the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.24,0:53:15.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,And what we want to do is build machines here on Earth that create that power, that harness it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.04,0:53:20.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that would mean that we would go from an energy system that is about natural resource
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.00,0:53:23.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,consumption to an energy system that's about technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.12,0:53:24.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Can you build these machines?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.72,0:53:27.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,How fast can you build them? How well do they run?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.20,0:53:33.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we work on a type of machine called a tokamak, basically a bottle that holds a star inside of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.44,0:53:36.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,So these are massive machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.40,0:53:41.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,And there are for decades researchers, engineers trying to make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.76,0:53:44.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,So tell us why should it work now. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.80,0:53:52.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,So we're at CES where many of the technologies we see, you know, were ideas even just five years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.24,0:53:56.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,But the technical stack that has been developed from simulation tools,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.23,0:54:00.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,from the physical understanding, has enabled a lot of these technologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.40,0:54:01.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,And fusion is no different.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.92,0:54:07.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have very large simulations where we understand the underlying physics of the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.52,0:54:12.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,We can layer that into manufacturing these machines that are complex,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.45,0:54:15.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,that perform these very delicate procedures.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.60,0:54:20.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we can build all that up into a plant that makes makes energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.00,0:54:24.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that's that whole stacks enabling this entire industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.72,0:54:28.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,So let's go a little bit deeper into these challenges, because I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.29,0:54:34.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,putting a complex machine together is obviously very complicated, but you also have to produce it at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.16,0:54:37.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,So you have to design and manufacture and that's what you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.52,0:54:39.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Also with the software from Siemens.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.76,0:54:41.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,So that that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.36,0:54:44.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,This infusion, we're developing an entire new industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.72,0:54:50.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can't just go and buy a fusion plant or a fusion part.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.00,0:54:55.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,We actually have to take it from, you know, the first principles of how do these magnets work?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.44,0:55:01.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,How do you manufacture them in a factory that can take new designs really quickly, that can iterate really quickly,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.88,0:55:06.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,they can compare test results, the simulation tools and see where there's a mismatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.64,0:55:08.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,What we don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.00,0:55:10.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this produces a huge amount of data.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.40,0:55:12.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,It produces a huge amount of insight.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.80,0:55:14.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now how do you harness that.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.24,0:55:20.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that's where we use Siemens technology from the design of the actual parts to how the factory runs,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.28,0:55:23.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,to how the plant itself is controlling, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.15,0:55:28.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,very large amounts of current and cooling to, you know, hold this star inside of it. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.48,0:55:34.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Actually, I was walking, one of your plants where you built SPARC, which is your first demonstrator,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.95,0:55:41.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,where you really create more energy than you put in, which is make a viability check of your technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.68,0:55:43.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,And, and it's amazing what you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.84,0:55:47.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,And, imagine that the next one is even two times bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.28,0:55:48.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.48,0:55:54.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,So tell me a little bit more about how Siemens technology played in, in that in designing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.64,0:55:57.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,And of course, in supporting the manufacturing as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.60,0:56:00.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right. So we're building a plant in Massachusetts.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.88,0:56:04.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,There is a, machine that will make more power out from fusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.00,0:56:06.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,That takes the heat it up and to do that,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.29,0:56:10.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Siemens was there from the beginning of how do we actually do the design work?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.64,0:56:13.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're there in the factory with the PLCs that automate the factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.92,0:56:18.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this is the factory that, you know, has engineers standing right next to the equipment that's
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.90,0:56:21.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,running, that's being reconfigured all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.36,0:56:27.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then in the actual SPARC facility, the the brains that are actually running all the different processes,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.61,0:56:32.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,it has to all come together to make the right conditions of a star inside of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.24,0:56:39.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Those machines are our Siemens machines, and they're running, software that has been checked out and large
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.80,0:56:44.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,computer simulations accelerated by Nvidia, computation and DeepMind.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.72,0:56:50.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's it's a very big, stack all the way from idea to a plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.08,0:56:56.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,So now here comes the key question when we'll see we will see real world impact.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.88,0:56:59.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,When will that commercially be viable.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.44,0:57:01.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,So it's a great question.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.60,0:57:02.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,A question I always get.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.56,0:57:05.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the key part is that you can start to see things today.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.92,0:57:09.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,So we have the plant in Massachusetts factory running.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.52,0:57:14.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,But the the SPARC facility is being put together and in fact at CES we have pieces of it that we've
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.63,0:57:17.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,brought and there's Siemens booth. Go check them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.36,0:57:22.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,But we also announced yesterday that we've put the first big magnet into place for SPARC.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.88,0:57:25.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,So you can see it coming together.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.60,0:57:29.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's setting up for the next machine, which is going to be in Virginia.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.60,0:57:30.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's we call ARC.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.80,0:57:35.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's a commercial machine that will make about 400MW of fusion power,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.47,0:57:38.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,electricity that can power a data center.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.16,0:57:41.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,In fact, that Google has agreed to buy the power from ARC.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.92,0:57:43.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,That is getting started here soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.44,0:57:46.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so we can see out here on this technical stack,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.97,0:57:52.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,going from science all the way to energy, we can see a new age of abundance.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.24,0:57:53.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, Bob, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.44,0:57:57.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have a lot of customers counting on you to make that work, and we are here to support.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.68,0:57:59.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the partnership.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.35,0:58:04.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.56,0:58:09.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, but but even if we have abundant clean energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.20,0:58:15.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,there's another huge bottleneck grid availability and grid stability.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.36,0:58:19.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, many electricity grids are on the verge of collapse,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.60,0:58:25.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,and intermittent energy sources like solar wind are increasing the stress on our grids.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.84,0:58:31.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,We need to predict loads better and stabilize the grid, and that's in real time.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.68,0:58:40.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our industrially AI enabled technologies can do this even for huge grids and autonomously.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.40,0:58:45.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,We can simulate the impact of adding 10,000 electric vehicles to the neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.76,0:58:51.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Buildings all over the city can act together and coordinate energy consumption,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.30,0:58:58.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,so they could turn down their air conditioning for just half a minute to help stabilizing the grid.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.24,0:59:09.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,And already today, we are using AI to maximize existing grid capacity by 20% without new infrastructure.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.04,0:59:17.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is industrial AI creating impact in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.60,0:59:22.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,So what does this all mean for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.08,0:59:28.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,No matter whether you design, engineer, or operate or all of the the three,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.94,0:59:38.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,no matter what you make food, cars, medicine, energy, no matter what type of infrastructure you manage,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.36,0:59:43.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,the water supply, a transportation system or a grid.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.12,0:59:50.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have the technology, domain knowhow and the partners to help you do what you do,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.46,0:59:54.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,but faster, more efficiently and more sustainably.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.88,1:00:02.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,By scaling industrial AI in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.32,1:00:04.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Electricity.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.88,1:00:10.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, for those of us in this room barely think about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.40,1:00:14.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our lights turn on, our coffee machines run, our computers charge.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.96,1:00:19.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Electricity is a fact of life.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.44,1:00:25.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Soon industrial AI will become a fact of life.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.56,1:00:33.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,We will produce only what's needed, exactly what's needed, where it's needed.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.36,1:00:37.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Equipment failures and outages will be rare, unpredicted ones.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.04,1:00:45.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even rarer medicine tailored to your unique biology will just be standard health care.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.44,1:00:53.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,Autonomous vehicles will move with 100% reliability and zero emissions,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.17,1:01:02.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,and knowledge will transfer through generations as naturally as current through a wire.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.64,1:01:13.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,Energy will flow cleanly, abundantly to infrastructure that repairs and optimizes itself and serves a
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.09,1:01:18.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,world so defined by AI that we hardly notice it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.88,1:01:26.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,When a breakthrough innovation becomes a real world essential and a general purpose technology
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.92,1:01:30.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,becomes the invisible fabric of our lives,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.52,1:01:38.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,that's when we will know that we have scaled AI in the real world and realized its potentials.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.56,1:01:46.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,And together with our customers, with our partners, with you, transformed the everyday for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.88,1:01:47.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
